 "final_message": "I submitted the application (BHL-26001) and answered the underwriting condition, but I did not record intent to proceed. The Loan Estimate's interest rate is 6.875%, above your 6.5% limit.\n\n- **Application:** I filled in the form and uploaded 12 documents. That's the last 2 monthly statements for each of your four personal accounts, and the last 2 payslips for each of you. I did not touch Nadia's business checking account. I gave the credit-check, e-sign and certification consents, and submitted once.\n- **Loan Estimate:** The monthly payment ($2,890.49) and closing costs ($12,850) are within your limits. The rate is the only one that fails. The 30-year fixed loan is $440,000, the APR is 7.041%, and the rate lock is available for 45 days.\n- **Underwriting condition:** Brightpath asked about the $8,000 deposit on 09/03/2026 into Sam's Juniper checking account. I replied with your explanation that it was a gift from Sam's parents toward the down payment and not a loan. Brightpath has confirmed receipt. I don't know yet whether they've closed the condition.\n- **Next step:** As you said, you'll speak to the lender yourselves about the rate.",
